  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nUpcoming Elections - Government - Jackson County, Iowa\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n \n \n\n Menu\n \n \n\n Search\n \n \n \n\n \n\n About \n \n\n Boards & Commissions\n Cemeteries\n Communities\n Elected Officials\n School Districts\n Township Information\n \n \n \n\n Departments \n \n\n Assessor\n Auditor\n Board of Supervisors\n Conservation\n County Attorney\n Emergency Management\n Engineer's Office & Secondary Roads\n Environmental Health\n General Assistance\n GIS\n Human Resources\n Mental Health\n Recorder\n Sheriff\n Treasurer\n Veterans Affairs\n Waste Authority of Jackson County\n Zoning\n \n \n Contact\n \n \n\n Bid Notices\n Calendar\n Courts\n Employment\n FAQ\n \n\n Translate Language\n \n Translate\n \n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n Search Jackson County, Iowa\n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n 2026 Special School Election Unofficial ResultsUnofficial Results \n\n\n\n\n\n\n \nElections & Voting\n \n\nUpcoming Elections\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \nView the dates listed below for upcoming elections in Jackson County. \n\n \n\n2026 Elections \n\n 2026 General Election\n \n\n November 3, 2026\n\n General Election \n \n\n A General Election is the election in which federal and state officers, members of Congress and of the general assembly, county and township officers, and other officers appear on the ballot. General Elections are held the 1st Tuesday after the 1st Monday in November of each even-numbered year. \n \n \n\n Sample Ballot(s)\n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n\n \nElections & Voting\n Am I Registered?\n Register to Vote\n How to Vote\n Voting Precincts\n Absentee Voting\n Military/Overseas Voting\n Voter ID\n Upcoming Elections\n Election Results\n Election Types\n Precinct Election Officials\n Elected Officials\n Maps\n \nAuditor & Elections FAQ\n Department Home\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n Jackson County Courthouse\n 201 W. Platt St.\n\n Maquoketa, IA 52060\n\n Contact Us\n \n \n\n \n \n \n